<title>INDIA: India's NALCO 1st half 96/97 net 2.36 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>India's NALCO 1st half 96/97 net 2.36 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-September</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    2,364.7  vs 2,015.8</p>
<p>    Sales		   8,303.0  vs 7,696.4</p>
<p>    Other income	    305.8  vs   225.2</p>
<p>    Total expenditure   4,902.3  vs 4,166.1</p>
<p>    Interest		  231.6  vs   587.3</p>
<p>    Gross profit	  3,732.7  vs 3,384.3</p>
<p>    Depreciation	  1,368.0  vs 1,368.5</p>
<p>    Tax			   nil  vs     nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Indian's state-owned National Aluminium Co Ltd (NALCO) released the results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
